sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: EVConnectedPreSession<br>Simulates that the EV and EVSE of the simulated Charging Station are connected
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 1: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the status change of the connector
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Occupied)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Occupied, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
    CSMS-->>CS: CSMS responds accordingly

    alt State is Authorized
        CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = CablePluggedIn, transactionInfo.chargingState = EVConnected, evse.id = Configured evseId, evse.connectorId = Configured connectorId)
    else State is not Authorized
        CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Started, triggerReason = CablePluggedIn, transactionInfo.chargingState = EVConnected, evse.id = Configured evseId, evse.connectorId = Configured connectorId)
    end
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Tool validations: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: State is EVConnectedPreSession
